/-- The quotient of `lib R X` by the equivalence relation generated by this relation will give us
the free Lie algebra. -/
/-
**FreeLieAlgebra.Rel** 是 Mathlib 中的一个归纳类型，位于命名空间 `FreeLieAlgebra`。
形式化陈述：(R : Type u) →   (X : Type v) → [inst : CommRing R] → FreeNonUnitalNonAsso
cAlgebra R X → FreeNonUnitalNonAssocAlgebra R X → Prop
黑盒内容：本声明未引用其他定理/引理；其成立仅依赖定义、结构与类型类实例。

--- 原说明 ---
The quotient of `lib R X` by the equivalence relation generated by this relation
 will give us
the free Lie algebra.
-/
inductive Rel : lib R X → lib R X → Prop
  | lie_self (a : lib R X) : Rel (a * a) 0
  | leibniz_lie (a b c : lib R X) : Rel (a * (b * c)) (a * b * c + b * (a * c))
  | smul (t : R) {a b : lib R X} : Rel a b → Rel (t • a) (t • b)
  | add_right {a b : lib R X} (c : lib R X) : Rel a b → Rel (a + c) (b + c)
  | mul_left (a : lib R X) {b c : lib R X} : Rel b c → Rel (a * b) (a * c)
  | mul_right {a b : lib R X} (c : lib R X) : Rel a b → Rel (a * c) (b * c)

variable {R X}
/-
**FreeLieAlgebra.Rel.addLeft** 是 Mathlib 中的一个定理，位于命名空间 `FreeLieAlgebra.Rel`。
形式化陈述：∀ {R : Type u} {X : Type v} [inst : CommRing R] (a : FreeNonUnitalNonAssoc
Algebra R X)   {b c : FreeNonUnitalNonAssocAlgebra R X}, FreeLieAlgebra.Rel R X 
b c → FreeLieAlgebra.Rel R X (a + b) (a + c)
参数：a : FreeNonUnitalNonAssocAlgebra R X；a + b；a + c。
黑盒证明引用了以下数学事实（定理与引理）：
· 使用定理 `congrArg`：∀ {α : Sort u} {β : Sort v} {a₁ a₂ : α} (f : α → β), a₁ = a₂ →
 f a₁ = f a₂
· 使用定理 `add_comm`：∀ {G : Type u_1} [inst : AddCommMagma G] (a b : G), a + b = b 
+ a
